    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d575">

                <pb facs="0897" n="879" sameAs="frus:frus1947v03/pg879"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.48/4–947: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Embassy in Italy
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-04-09T18:00:00-05:00">April 9, 1947—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>504. Preliminary conversation held with representatives Italian Govt. March 27 re
                    U.S. relief assistance.</p>
                <p>Memo of conversation will be forwarded.</p>
                <p>Have delivered tentative draft agreement Italian reps, containing terms operation
                    U.S. and Italy and including restrictions and requirements bill in
                        Congress.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d575-f1"/> Ital. reps. probably will forward
                    Rome draft. Copies draft agreements dispatched today ur info. Send comments
                    immediately.</p>
                <p>No agreements will be signed until final passage Congress end April. Ital reps,
                    asked submit tentative relief import food needs May June, July.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d575-f1" n="1" xml:id="d575-f1-content">
                <p>The draft text of the proposed agreement was sent to Rome in the Department’s
                    telegraphic instruction 895, June 11, not printed (805.48/6–1147).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
